<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="2">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="D.W. BURBANK"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Burbank - Morning</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>LOCATION: On Burbank Blvd. Right by </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Witnall</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Hwy</Text>
      <Text>. Town sign in medium. We’ll be quick.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. Burbank</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Heya</Text>
      <Text> pal, looks like someone’s got the grumps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>As D.W. speaks, Alec rises to his feet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What’s the matter? NoHo run ya out?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec revs up to vent. D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">raises</Text>
      <Text> a finger, looks to the heavens then grabs his lapels.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The name’s D.W. Burbank, </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">siddles</Text>
      <Text> up and rib jabs Alec.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">and</Text>
      <Text> I’m here to tell ya, friend:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>There’s no need to be down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">walks</Text>
      <Text> onward, arms outstretched.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Come to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">Burbank</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec stumbles after as he confusedly complies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="D.W. BURBANK"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Here in burbank - Day - ConTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>LOCATION:   The Chandler Bike Path: Nice Burbank Side</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">throws</Text>
      <Text> his arm around Alec and waves a great gesture towards Burbank.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>SINGING BEGINS:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Here in Burbank, we’re very clean.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">pulls</Text>
      <Text> his hand off Alec’s shoulder and rubs thumb to finger as he frowns at Alec.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Goodness your coat is most obscene!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Our municipality.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Is the best in the valley.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">leads</Text>
      <Text> Alec through parks and various locals around Burbank. At one point, D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">tries</Text>
      <Text> to cheer Alec up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We have cuisine from every culture.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s pretty much a better </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">EPCOT</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But if you’re craving </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">swedish</Text>
      <Text> meatballs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And need prefab furniture.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We have </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">IKEA</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>SINGING ENDS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">pants</Text>
      <Text> slightly as he’s out of breath. Then he leans in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But that’s not all!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">pulls</Text>
      <Text> back and throws his arms wide.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We’re building a bigger one!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. Reaches forward and grabs both of Alec’s arms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Come I’ll show ya!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Wisks</Text>
      <Text> Alec away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="D.W. BURBANK"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Construction site</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">stands</Text>
      <Text> with Alec at the perimeter fence of the site of the new </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">IKEA</Text>
      <Text>. D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">stands</Text>
      <Text> proud with his hands on his hips.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. Marvels at the progress.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Isn’t it beautiful?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">leans</Text>
      <Text> in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s going to be the biggest in the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">whole world</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That is an impressive feat of engineering.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So ...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">what’s</Text>
      <Text> your story friend?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec straightens himself up, pulls his tie back up tight for the first time on this journey. He holds up a finger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>SINGING BEGINS:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>My name is Alec Reidel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And the news runs in my family.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>From newsreels to the newspaper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And then I anchored my own show.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We brought the world to NoHo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>While providing social commentary. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Ratings dipped when truth was told.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But I kept pushing forward, so</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They took my own show from me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And they gave it to two </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">imbecils</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And then they ran me out of town.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Even though I was right. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But it really doesn’t matter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What? It really doesn’t matter?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No, it really doesn’t matter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So this pickle that you think you’re in. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Is nothing but a speed bump, friend. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So buck up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’re in Burbank and we’ve got something for everyone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>SINGING ENDS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">shuttle’s</Text>
      <Text> Alec off to present more of the best of Burbank. Alec is </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">non-plussed</Text>
      <Text> at the art, food and shopping provided by the town.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="D.W. BURBANK"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. Beer House - ConTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Finally D.W. Lands on beer. Alec shows interest. D.W. Is pleased to know he’s “in.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>They cheers and drink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Cam whip down to table, flash cut to five pint glasses and an appetizer plate on the table.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Cam up, Alec and D.W. Are drinking. D.W. Finishes his sip.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Ooh</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Hoppy</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec springs back to life. Full on-air persona.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Actually.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That’s a wheat beer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Wheaty</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. Puts down his glass and fixes his gaze up Alec.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We have a job for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec scoffs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>In Burbank?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">raises</Text>
      <Text> a finger and an eyebrow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="5" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="D.W. BURBANK"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="EDITOR"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. Brown brick building - Newspaper - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">drags</Text>
      <Text> Alec into frame.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.w. BURBANK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Print. News.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And you’re just the man for the job.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec bristles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You still run print in Burbank?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">stands</Text>
      <Text> tall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>SINGING BEGINS:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. BURBANK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I can see that you’re a fighter and a good man, mister Reidel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And the folks like you sure come in short supply. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>See, we don’t normally do this:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But WE NEED YA!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yes, The Burbank Telegraph is right for you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So wipe off that frown and give us your opinion. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Something you’re uniquely qualified to do.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well, the citizens of NoHo ran me out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So I’m here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now I’ve thrown away my family’s legacy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But the streets are clean and Burbank isn’t as bad as I thought.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I can finally speak the truth and it be heard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Editor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hey, is that the guy that showed the world that nipple?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So, it’s true those bastards ran you out of town.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Editorials would suit you. You’ve got guts, kid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Let this platform be the place that you’ll call home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>SINGING ENDS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>D.W. Burbank</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Whudda</Text>
      <Text> ya say?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Kay!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>D.W. Strikes a triumphant finale pose.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

